Adapted from J2ME-Loader, https://github.com/nikita36078/J2ME-Loader, commit 4baada3fe6a99598b83ec83d37a6185d59071e68.
Apache-2.0 licensed individual source files by Yury Kharchenko and Nikita Shakarun.
Original copyright/license headers retained in imported API, loader and animation files.
Java3DS replaces Android/OpenGL/JNI platform code with a software rasterizer,
heap-backed buffers, a small platform adapter and HID sensor input.
Experimental Micro3D omits lighting, toon/sphere effects and command-list primitives.
The original J2ME-Loader repository's separate GPL components are not included.
